WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.639
Do  you  believe  that  Iran  violated  the  peace  agreement  and  the  peace -fire

2
00:00:04.639 --> 00:00:05.099
agreement?

3
00:00:05.459 --> 00:00:07.580
Do  you  believe  that  Iran  is  still  committed  to  peace?

4
00:00:08.519 --> 00:00:09.000
Yeah,  I  do.

5
00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.759
They  violated  it,  but  Israel  violated  it,  too.

6
00:00:11.759 --> 00:00:13.500
Are  you  questioning  if  Israel  is  committed  to  peace?

7
00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.739
Israel,  as  soon  as  we  made  the  deal,  they  came  out  and  they  dropped

8
00:00:16.739 --> 00:00:17.559
a  load  of  bombs,

9
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.539
the  likes  of  which  I've  never  seen  before.

10
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.379
The  biggest  load  that  we've  seen.

11
00:00:21.679 --> 00:00:22.960
I'm  not  happy  with  Israel.

12
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:26.120
You  know,  when  I  say,  okay,  now  you  have  12  hours,

13
00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.699
you  don't  go  out  in  the  first  hour  and  just  drop  everything  you  have

14
00:00:29.699 --> 00:00:29.980
on  them.

15
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.179
So  I'm  not  happy  with  them.

16
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.259
I'm  not  happy  with  Iran  either.

17
00:00:33.399 --> 00:00:36.420
But  I'm  really  unhappy  if  Israel  is  going  out  this  morning

18
00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:39.659
because  the  one  rocket  that  didn't  land,  that  was  shot,

19
00:00:39.899 --> 00:00:43.420
perhaps  by  mistake,  that  didn't  land,  I'm  not  happy  about  that.

20
00:00:45.659 --> 00:00:46.039
You  know  what?

21
00:00:46.039 --> 00:00:48.340
We  have,  we  basically  have  two  countries

22
00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:51.200
that  have  been  fighting  so  long  and  so  hard

23
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.719
that  they  don't  know  what  the  fuck  they're  doing.

24
00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:54.679
Do  you  understand  that?

25
00:00:56.119 --> 00:00:57.079
I  don't  understand.

